{"prompt": "the chain of declarations the caret is inside, outermost first, in TypeScript", "response": "```typescript\nexport function ancestry(entries: OutlineEntry[], line: number): OutlineEntry[] {\n  let index = enclosing(entries, line);\n  if (index < 0) return [];\n\n  const chain: OutlineEntry[] = [];\n  let depth = entries[index]?.depth ?? 0;\n  for (; index >= 0; index -= 1) {\n    const entry = entries[index];\n    if (!entry) continue;\n    if (entry.depth === depth) {\n      chain.unshift(entry);\n      depth -= 1;\n    }\n    if (depth < 0) break;\n  }\n  return chain;\n}\n```"}
